Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.44,0:00:06.69,Main,Narino,0,0,0,,You know... You really messed up this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.14,0:00:12.04,Main,Narino,0,0,0,,Dad's still pissed. You're honestly lucky \Nthis is the extent of your punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.84,0:00:16.07,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Onee-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.09,0:01:57.05,Episode Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1450,950)\shad0}#3 "{\c&H418FE5&}T{\c}h{\c&H418FE5&}e{\c}y {\c&H418FE5&}S{\c}h{\c&H418FE5&}o{\c}w {\c&H418FE5&}U{\c}p {\c&H418FE5&}W{\c}h{\c&H418FE5&}e{\c}n {\c&H418FE5&}Y{\c}o{\c&H418FE5&}u {\c}L{\c&H418FE5&}e{\c}a{\c&H418FE5&}s{\c}t {\c&H418FE5&}E{\c}x{\c&H418FE5&}p{\c}e{\c&H418FE5&}c{\c}t {\c&H418FE5&}I{\c}t"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.26,0:02:00.22,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H0E196D&\bord0\pos(214,262)\fay.09\frx356\fry10}Tanisaki Bread
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.26,0:02:01.20,Main,Old Lady,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.20,0:02:05.27,Main,Old Lady,0,0,0,,Hey, those two girls were first. \NI was watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.09,0:02:09.98,Italics,Aki,0,0,0,,Yoshino!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.98,0:02:11.94,Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, Aki-sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.94,0:02:15.92,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I need you to add five rice balls \Nto that order of breads.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.92,0:02:17.40,Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.08,0:02:27.30,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.72,0:02:30.04,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,What's everyone's problem?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.44,0:02:32.82,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,First comes muscles...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.73,0:02:36.26,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Second comes muscles...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.26,0:02:39.72,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,There's no third or fourth...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.72,0:02:42.17,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Fifth comes muscles...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.31,0:02:50.50,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,M-Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.31,0:02:51.27,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an5\fs10\c&HB9A060&\frz6.8\bord1\pos(154,252)\3c&HFDFCF6&}D{\c&HB69C60&}e{\c&HB2995F&}o{\c&HAF955F&}d{\c&HAC915F&}o{\c&HA98D5F&}r{\c&HA58A5E&}i{\c&HA2865E&}z{\c&H9F825E&}i{\c&H9B7F5D&}n{\c&H987B5D&}g\N{\c&H95775D&}M{\c&H92735D&}i{\c&H8E705C&}s{\c&H8B6C5C&}t
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.31,0:02:51.27,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an5\fs6\c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\3c&HCDC22E&\pos(172.667,263.333)\frz8.128}Unscented
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.13,0:02:54.48,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you knew I was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.48,0:02:57.18,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,The student store is right below here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.18,0:02:59.85,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I thought I heard some creepy yelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.85,0:03:01.58,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Don't say it's creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.58,0:03:04.83,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Running away to your muscles \Nisn't going to change Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.33,0:03:11.33,Black Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(128.667,82)\an5\fs10\bord0\frz3.97\frx34\fry350}Salmon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.66,0:03:11.33,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,But seriously, that's so much food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.63,0:03:14.06,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,She's been eating more again as of late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.06,0:03:16.25,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,She hasn't changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.70,0:03:19.30,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Basically, no. But she's \Ngotten a little sloppier.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:21.26,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Oh... I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.06,0:03:32.31,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Damn it! How is she able to \Ntwist the truth so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.14,0:03:36.86,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,You don't have any idea, \Neither, right? It's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.67,0:03:43.99,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Aki-sama was going through a lot back then... \NSo she might be confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.99,0:03:47.93,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,So she conveniently manipulated \Nher memories for her own sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.58,0:03:51.39,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Well, anyway, Aki-sama's starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.39,0:03:55.42,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Pig's Foot, I'll try to smooth \Nthings over with Aki-sama, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.42,0:03:59.05,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,You're the best, Master! \NYou're truly the only one I can rely on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.32,0:04:02.74,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I might not be able to do much, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.87,0:04:04.73,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.83,0:04:08.98,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,It's not like her to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.47,0:04:13.16,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Can't you wait a little longer on the payment?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.16,0:04:15.48,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,This is no time to show off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.84,0:04:19.07,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,All right. I'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.49,0:04:26.39,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Well, you seem busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.71,0:04:30.56,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,I heard you got quite the scolding at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.56,0:04:32.41,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Must be hard being a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.78,0:04:34.37,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,It doesn't concern you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.37,0:04:39.58,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Well, that's not true. \NI'm your master's fiancé, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.51,0:04:48.22,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Adagaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.22,0:04:50.96,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I was wrong about everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.96,0:04:54.06,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Even if you're trying to fabricate everything \Nand act like the tragic heroine,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.52,0:04:56.52,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I still love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.52,0:05:00.61,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Makabe... You'll still love me if I'm fake?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.61,0:05:05.30,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Yes! Putting a lid on our problems! \NThat's just the right thing to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.07,0:05:08.53,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Thank you, Makabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.05,0:05:14.71,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Makabe-kun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.71,0:05:20.17,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,It's no use. Even if there was a way out \Nof this stalemate, I don't think I'd last.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.95,0:05:23.08,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Did you hit your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.33,0:05:28.43,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Uh, no... I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:31.14,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,You seem rather tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.47,0:05:34.22,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Er, yeah... a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.67,0:05:38.25,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Say, Masamune-sama. \NDo you have some time after school?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.25,0:05:39.10,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:42.07,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,There's somewhere I'd like to go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.29,0:05:51.70,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.17,0:05:54.00,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.00,0:05:57.18,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Yes. It's just a follow-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.68,0:06:02.25,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,When you asked me to come with you, \Nthis wasn't what I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.25,0:06:05.44,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Well, Shidou isn't here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.44,0:06:08.43,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, I'll take her place today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.81,0:06:11.68,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Did you think we'd go somewhere \Nmore fitting for a rendezvous?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.68,0:06:13.61,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Wha— I just—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.61,0:06:15.08,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Why don't we take a little walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.89,0:06:21.64,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Moderate exercise and saying \Neverything you're thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.64,0:06:24.25,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,are both very important to your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.32,0:06:30.32,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,I see... So that's what happened in Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.67,0:06:34.54,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's my fault for not being able \Nto hold back and going off on her...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.54,0:06:38.22,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,I did think things seemed \Na bit different than usual,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.22,0:06:40.96,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,but that is quite worrisome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.96,0:06:45.71,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,It is! It's putting my whole \Nrevenge plan in jeopardy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.89,0:06:51.72,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,You still haven't given up on this revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.17,0:06:53.18,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.50,0:06:55.89,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Do you want Aki-sama to fall in love with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.52,0:06:58.85,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Well... yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.85,0:07:02.86,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Even though you loathe her \Nand she makes you sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.94,0:07:06.92,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Th-That's exactly why I'm going to dump her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.92,0:07:09.07,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,That'll be my revenge, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.74,0:07:16.49,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,That's not what you'd call love anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.49,0:07:19.12,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,What the heck? Of course it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.20,0:07:27.00,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,What's... going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.42,0:07:29.97,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,I thought I'd be a little courageous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.66,0:07:33.12,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,You're going to choose Adagaki Aki.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.12,0:07:37.18,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,But that's for the sake of revenge, not love.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.18,0:07:42.35,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Which would mean that if we fell in love, \Nyou wouldn't be cheating on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.35,0:07:43.70,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Fujinomiya-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.04,0:07:46.98,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Masamune-sama, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.76,0:07:49.93,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Let's run.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.93,0:07:50.57,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.88,0:07:53.69,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,What in the world is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.00,0:08:02.54,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,I'm finally here, Aki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.88,0:08:06.25,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Sorry, one of the teachers \Nasked me to do something,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.72,0:08:09.40,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,and it took longer than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.48,0:08:12.62,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,No, it's totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.62,0:08:14.04,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,I know, Aki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.04,0:08:16.94,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Why don't we stop by a family restaurant \Non our way home to eat something sweet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.94,0:08:19.45,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,I heard there's some new dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.45,0:08:22.80,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Oh, really? Let's go, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.80,0:08:24.06,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,You don't mind, right, Yoshino?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.40,0:08:31.07,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Aki-sama, I'm terribly sorry, \Nbut I'd like to head back to the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.48,0:08:33.03,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Oh, okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.16,0:08:47.50,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I wonder what's wrong with Yoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.50,0:08:49.53,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Well, we should get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.53,0:08:51.71,Main,Sonoka,0,0,0,,Just a dang minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.57,0:09:09.18,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Wh-What's going on, Masamune-sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.18,0:09:11.00,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Who are those people?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.00,0:09:14.82,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,That's Muriel's big brother. \NYou know, that girl I met in Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.24,0:09:19.83,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Shit, shit, shit! This definitely has to do \Nwith our teaching Muriel about rom-coms!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.13,0:09:27.96,Main,Skinhead,0,0,0,,That's as far as you're gonna go, guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.88,0:09:32.73,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Masamune-sama, I'll throw up \Nsome blood to cause a diversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.73,0:09:35.61,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I don't think that'll work \Nnow that you're healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.61,0:09:38.32,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,My body has become quite inconvenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.32,0:09:39.80,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Don't seem so sad about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.26,0:09:44.98,Main,Frank,0,0,0,,Where are you trying to \Nrun off to, Chikuwa-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.98,0:09:48.22,Main,Frank,0,0,0,,I heard you took good care \Nof my sister the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.22,0:09:50.64,Main,Frank,0,0,0,,Nah, you didn't take care of her at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.64,0:09:53.65,Main,Frank,0,0,0,,Because you ran off in the middle \Nof it and went back to Japan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.65,0:09:55.66,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I had a good reason for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.66,0:09:58.20,Main,Frank,0,0,0,,Non! I don't want to hear any excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.20,0:09:59.70,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,A gun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.25,0:10:04.12,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.12,0:10:08.00,Main,Frank,0,0,0,,If it was up to me, I'd happily\Nfill you with lead, but alas...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.05,0:10:14.50,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Muriel's manuscript?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.50,0:10:19.89,Main,Frank,0,0,0,,After you two left Paris, \Nmy sister kept drawing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.89,0:10:23.16,Main,Frank,0,0,0,,Even at the expense of eating and sleeping!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.81,0:10:26.86,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Actually, she's gotten a lot better...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.86,0:10:30.79,Main,Frank,0,0,0,,I'm assuming she got some \Ninspiration after seeing you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.77,0:10:36.30,Main,Frank,0,0,0,,And whatever that inspiration was is why \NI'm letting you off the hook just this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.30,0:10:37.24,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Um—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.63,0:10:42.95,Main,Frank,0,0,0,,I'll just say this. I also prefer happy endings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.57,0:10:45.91,Main,Frank,0,0,0,,Because reality is an absolute shithole.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.92,0:10:51.40,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,May I take a look, as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.40,0:10:53.21,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,S-Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.18,0:11:01.26,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,You look awful. Wipe off your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.45,0:11:10.60,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,My parents are separating.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.62,0:11:16.36,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,This time, it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.87,0:11:21.07,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm gonna keep supporting you \Nso you can cheer up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.39,0:11:25.53,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Thank you, but I'm going to go with my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.53,0:11:28.40,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Even then, our hearts will always be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:30.25,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Let's see each other again when we're older.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.18,0:11:45.14,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,You look awful. Wipe off your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.55,0:11:47.56,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you knew it was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:51.71,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,There's no way I wouldn't be able to tell. \NYou'll always be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.85,0:11:55.81,Black Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(284,240)\an5\c&H3D566B&\3c&HB5DAE4&\bord1\fnTrebuchet MS\blur1\frz347.2\fax-.2\frx24\fry0}The End.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.16,0:11:58.41,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,What a cute little story.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.41,0:12:00.28,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Yeah... I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.95,0:12:03.85,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Why didn't we end up like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.85,0:12:07.24,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,We ended up at odds with each other, \Nhating and hating back...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.48,0:12:11.26,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Masamune-sama, there's a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.63,0:12:19.64,Italics,Muriel,0,0,0,,Bonjour, Masamune!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.64,0:12:22.06,Italics,Muriel,0,0,0,,I hope you have been well, I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.06,0:12:25.76,Italics,Muriel,0,0,0,,I drew a manga inspired by you and Aki.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.76,0:12:29.64,Italics,Muriel,0,0,0,,You never told me how everything ended, \Nso I gave it my own original ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.64,0:12:36.22,Italics,Muriel,0,0,0,,I wish I could become a wall in your \Nroom and learn even more about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.00,0:12:40.80,Italics,Muriel,0,0,0,,The walls have ears, and the doors have eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.80,0:12:43.16,Italics,Muriel,0,0,0,,Yours truly, Muriel Besson.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.57,0:12:46.90,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Walls? There's gotta be \Na better way to say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.72,0:12:49.21,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Let me see that real quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.21,0:12:50.62,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Masamune-sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.04,0:12:54.33,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,This story started out happy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.72,0:12:58.04,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,but in reality, it never got a happy ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.57,0:13:00.52,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,But if I look at it from \Na different perspective...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:04.63,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Is that what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.19,0:13:17.19,Black Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs12\c&H505554&\frz17.59\pos(286,324.667)}The End.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.03,0:13:24.57,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Onii-chan, you're the worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.57,0:13:27.32,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,My... My spine...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.32,0:13:29.87,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,You went into my room without \Npermission again, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.87,0:13:32.76,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,And give me back the panties \Nand socks you stole the other day!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.76,0:13:34.83,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh?! What the hell are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.83,0:13:38.96,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,When I looked up at the second floor \Nfrom outside, I saw you in my room!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.92,0:13:41.26,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Why from outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.26,0:13:42.94,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Because I went to the convenience store.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.94,0:13:46.17,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Hey, are you eating \Njunk food before dinner again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.17,0:13:48.11,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,The hag's gonna yell at you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.11,0:13:49.47,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Don't change the subject!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.82,0:13:51.07,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Ugh, I've had enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.07,0:13:53.04,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,My brother wears his little sister's \Npanties on his head!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.04,0:13:56.23,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,And he wears just one of his little sister's \Nsocks and stretches it way out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.23,0:14:00.36,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,You're the absolute worse! Keep your \Nperversion limited to your muscles only!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.36,0:14:02.44,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Now, hang on! My muscles \Nare absolutely innocent here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.44,0:14:04.62,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,What's the matter, you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.62,0:14:07.96,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Huh? Mom, were you just upstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.96,0:14:13.29,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,Yes. I was taking you kids' \Nlaundry up to your rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.29,0:14:15.93,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Chinatsu...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.93,0:14:20.17,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,H-Huh? Maybe it was just my imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.17,0:14:22.79,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Oh, I know. Want some ice cream, Onii-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.79,0:14:23.85,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.63,0:14:28.62,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Mom! My panties and sock are missing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.62,0:14:30.89,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,Oh, dear. I wonder what happened to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.89,0:14:32.17,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.17,0:14:34.80,Main Top,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Where did they go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.38,0:14:36.02,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,People's minds aren't reliable at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:43.96,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,What's that? A manuscript?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.11,0:14:48.33,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,Maa-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.33,0:14:49.62,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go out for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.26,0:14:52.07,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,But it's almost time for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.04,0:14:56.91,Main,Sonoka,0,0,0,,Ah! Aki-sama's so cute here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.91,0:15:01.44,Main,Sonoka,0,0,0,,This lovely Aki-sama, this cute Aki-sama,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.44,0:15:03.92,Main,Sonoka,0,0,0,,and this noble Aki-sama! Give them all to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.92,0:15:07.12,Main,Sonoka,0,0,0,,Basically, give me all the Aki-samas!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.12,0:15:09.64,Main,Kikune,0,0,0,,I guess you really did go to Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.64,0:15:14.43,Main,Mari,0,0,0,,We went to the Eiffel Tower, \Nthe Louvre Museum, and Mont-Saint-Michel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.43,0:15:18.22,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,That was pretty rough. \NIt was pretty far from Paris, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.22,0:15:22.32,Main,Sonoka,0,0,0,,Aw, no fair. When I had my trip, \Nit was just to New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.32,0:15:25.40,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,At least you were in a place \Nwhere people understand English.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.40,0:15:29.10,Main,Kikune,0,0,0,,I cant even speak English, \Nso what am I going to do next year?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.10,0:15:33.53,Main,Sonoka,0,0,0,,But, hey... These are all group pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.53,0:15:35.74,Main,Mari,0,0,0,,Where are the pictures of \NAki-sama during her free time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.74,0:15:38.73,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,I don't actually have any, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.73,0:15:42.17,Main,Sonoka,0,0,0,,Hey, hang on a sec! \NHow worthless are you as a photographer?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.17,0:15:44.27,Main,Sonoka,0,0,0,,Did your battery die at the \Ncritical moment or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.27,0:15:45.76,Main,Kikune,0,0,0,,You're useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.76,0:15:50.34,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,That's not it. Aki-chan hung out \Nwith Makabe-kun, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.34,0:15:52.20,Main,Sonoka; Kikune; Mari,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.20,0:15:53.97,Main,Kikune,0,0,0,,Aki-sama, is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.80,0:15:56.81,Main,Mari,0,0,0,,I didn't notice at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.81,0:16:00.14,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,Sumire... Just a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.39,0:16:04.35,Flight Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fay-.17\fax.12\frx4\fry356\pos(436,36)\q2}Paris
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.39,0:16:04.35,Flight Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fay-.19\bord4\fax.12\frx4\fry356\c&H786872&\q2\pos(438,58)}New York
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.39,0:16:04.35,Flight Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fay-.2\fax.12\frx4\fry356\pos(440,78)\c&H776185&\q2}Cebu
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.39,0:16:04.35,Flight Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fay-.17\fax.12\frx4\fry356\pos(442,98)\c&H74588C&\q2}Taipei
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.39,0:16:04.35,Flight Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fay-.17\fax.12\frx4\fry356\pos(444,118)\c&H83739E&\q2}Honolulu
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.39,0:16:04.35,Flight Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fay-.17\fax.12\frx4\fry356\pos(446,138)\q2\c&H7A679F&}Los Angeles
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.39,0:16:04.35,Flight Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fay-.17\fax.12\frx4\fry356\pos(448,158)\q2\c&H716799&}Hong Kong
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.39,0:16:04.35,Flight Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fay-.17\fax.12\frx4\fry356\pos(450,179)\q2\c&H5C6882&}Taipei
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.39,0:16:04.35,Flight Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fay-.17\fax.12\frx4\fry356\pos(452,199)\c&H6F8498&\q2}London
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.99,0:16:04.35,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,What?! Sumire collapsed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.35,0:16:08.73,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,No... I need to know more. How is she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.73,0:16:13.45,Italics,Old Maid,0,0,0,,They acted quickly, \Nso she's stable now, at least...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.79,0:16:15.52,Italics,Old Maid,0,0,0,,How many times has it been now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.52,0:16:19.45,Italics,Old Maid,0,0,0,,The fee to keep her in a private \Nroom is already so high...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.45,0:16:22.57,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,We don't need a fancy private room!\NA shared room would be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.57,0:16:24.49,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Getting Sumire better should come first!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.49,0:16:27.29,Italics,Old Maid,0,0,0,,We couldn't possibly blemish \Nthe Gasou name in such a manner!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.44,0:16:33.45,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,The only one who needs to be tied down
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.45,0:16:37.29,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,by conventions, traditions, \Nand the Gasou name is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.29,0:16:40.60,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,There's no way I can let Sumire \Ngo through the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.08,0:16:43.52,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,I don't know what happened in Paris,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.53,0:16:45.93,Main Top,Mari,0,0,0,,We need to know more details.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.52,0:16:47.22,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,but I can't let her develop any \Naffection toward Makabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.75,0:16:49.82,Main,Mari,0,0,0,,Are you listening, Gasou?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.82,0:16:50.99,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.99,0:16:53.87,Main,Mari,0,0,0,,I held back because you were there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.87,0:16:55.05,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Whoops, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.05,0:16:58.63,Main,Sonoka,0,0,0,,Ugh! Aki-sama, are you cheating on us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.63,0:17:02.52,Main,Sonoka,0,0,0,,You have all of us and yet you \Nwent to France to go on a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.52,0:17:04.64,Main,Kikune,0,0,0,,Wait, maybe he threatened her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.64,0:17:06.41,Main,Sonoka,0,0,0,,What?! He won't get away with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.41,0:17:07.67,Main,Mari,0,0,0,,Absolutely unacceptable!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.67,0:17:10.02,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Could we not talk about that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.48,0:17:14.84,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Aki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.84,0:17:19.02,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,If you really feel that way, \Nstop hanging around Makabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.02,0:17:22.56,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Could you give me a little \Nmore thought instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.57,0:17:29.88,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I'm going to go wash my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.65,0:17:38.03,Main,Kikune,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.03,0:17:40.41,Main,Kikune,0,0,0,,You're getting way too cozy with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.41,0:17:43.48,Main,Mari,0,0,0,,You promised you wouldn't pursue her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.48,0:17:48.08,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,I-I know, but I couldn't keep quiet \Nanymore after what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.08,0:17:49.64,Main,Kikune,0,0,0,,The hell are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.64,0:17:53.00,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Look. This is why Aki-chan changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.35,0:17:57.34,Main,Sonoka; Kikune; Mari,0,0,0,,Makabe Masamune and Koiwai Yoshino?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.34,0:18:01.93,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Aki-chan's hurt. She was \Nbetrayed by someone she trusts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.93,0:18:07.48,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,That's why I thought it might be better \Nto force her to notice someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.48,0:18:08.56,Main,Mari,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.04,0:18:12.86,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,Even though this is all a lie, \NI win if I can get her to believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.67,0:18:19.67,Flashback,Yuisaki,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.25,0:18:25.94,Flashback,Yuisaki,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but aren't you the little boy \Nwho used to be friends with Aki-sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.94,0:18:27.80,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,Huh? Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.80,0:18:32.38,Flashback,Yuisaki,0,0,0,,I knew right away! You look exactly the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.38,0:18:34.34,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(950,0)\an4\c&H7C635E&\bord0\frx30\frz27.18\fax.1\pos(206.667,206.667)}gaki Group
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.38,0:18:34.34,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(950,0)\fnTimes New Roman\fs10\bord0\shad0\c&H506064&\frx30\frz27.18\fax.1\pos(272.666,217.333)}Secretary
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.73,0:18:36.09,Flashback,Yuisaki,0,0,0,,I'm the secretary to the head \Nof the Adagaki family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.09,0:18:37.98,Flashback,Yuisaki,0,0,0,,My name is Yuisaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.98,0:18:39.32,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,Adagaki...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.01,0:18:43.30,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you remember me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.70,0:18:48.75,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,Where is it? I know it's here somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.75,0:18:53.96,Flashback,Old Maid,0,0,0,,Kanetsugu-sama. You haven't even \Nchanged. What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.96,0:18:54.98,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.98,0:18:57.74,Flashback,Old Maid,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this, Kanetsugu-sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.74,0:18:59.26,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,The written oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.26,0:19:01.68,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,The one Grandfather made with \Nthe previous Adagaki family head
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.68,0:19:04.20,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,when he was still in his prime.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.45,0:19:07.90,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,I didn't think a single piece of \Npaper would do much good,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.90,0:19:10.03,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,but if I work this into \Neverything I heard today,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.03,0:19:12.54,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,I'll be able to suck the \NAdagaki family funds dry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.94,0:19:17.19,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,I'm going to go marry into their family!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.88,0:19:19.87,Main,Mari,0,0,0,,Aki-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.87,0:19:20.97,Main,Sonoka,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.34,0:19:22.30,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.84,0:19:23.90,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Aki-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.73,0:19:28.09,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I suddenly lashed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.09,0:19:31.98,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,It's okay. You don't have to tell me \Nwhat happened if you don't want to,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.98,0:19:35.61,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,but if you ever need to talk, \NI'll be there for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.75,0:19:38.99,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,I'm on your side, Aki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.99,0:19:45.37,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,I have no intention of rushing. I'll be \Nwaiting until you're ready, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.05,0:19:48.10,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,I'll wait forever for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.04,0:20:20.28,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Pig's Foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.97,0:20:23.10,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Aki-sama's not here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.10,0:20:25.45,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,She had a date with Kanetsugu today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.45,0:20:28.49,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,No, it's fine. That doesn't really matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.72,0:20:31.53,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I haven't been here in forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.53,0:20:34.21,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,This courtyard's much \Nsmaller than I remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.76,0:20:37.80,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,It's definitely bigger than mine, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.80,0:20:39.17,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Pig's Foot...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.48,0:20:42.50,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,It felt like it continued \Nto the ends of the earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.59,0:20:46.52,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,But it didn't, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.55,0:20:53.32,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Back in Paris, she had the nerve to act like \Nshe didn't know my Pig's Foot nickname.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.71,0:20:57.69,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Even though she's the one who \Ncalled me that when the bullies
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.69,0:20:59.52,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,were beating the crap out of me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.52,0:21:01.10,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,That pissed me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.10,0:21:03.83,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,There was no way I was going \Nto let her get away with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.25,0:21:07.99,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,But... What if there's a chance \Nshe's telling the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.45,0:21:12.19,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Thinking that made me feel a little uneasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.19,0:21:17.03,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Was the voice I heard here \Nreally Adagaki Aki's?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.50,0:21:20.42,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I don't follow. What are you getting at?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.80,0:21:24.89,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Back then, I thought the only \Nchild in this house was her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.38,0:21:28.34,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,That's why I never even \Nconsidered it could be someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.31,0:21:37.03,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,According to her, there was another child \Nher age at this mansion back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.42,0:21:40.15,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,who couldn't leave her room\Nbecause she had chickenpox.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.33,0:21:45.96,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,And... that she was \Nwatching us that whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.24,0:21:53.33,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,The only ones who know the nickname of \NPig's Foot are me, those bullies, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.83,0:21:56.54,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,the one who gave me that nickname.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.54,0:22:00.33,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,But... Adagaki Aki didn't remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.81,0:22:02.50,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,So then...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.72,0:22:06.13,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Why do you call me Pig's Foot?
